[{"title":"仙居阁","author":"沈辽","text":"鹤驭已归三十春，至今重阁无纤尘。\n蟠桃谁知天上事，白骨不驻城中人。\n门外江流似平昔，林间鸟雀空悲辛。\n当时留侯强辟谷，黄石老翁悟终身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45201,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题谭氏需亭","author":"沈辽","text":"谭子作需亭，佳客同宴乐。\n宴乐乃馀事，文华相博约。\n散帙列经史，所游尽通博。\n挥毫断新义，诸生困穿凿。\n中厨具烹饪，高怀肆杯杓。\n遥想大论时，纷纷麈毛落。\n春风豁幽郁，秋日延林薄。\n人生乐名教，安在甘寂寞。\n相期一穷达，岂止为脾臄。\n穷达乃在天，得时即鸣跃。\n在昔郑司农，处身固穷索。\n飨客颇丰侈，水陆荐金错。\n其后李北海，高材冠台阁。\n摛文示时彦，万金资一酌。\n遗风不在是，斯名岂苟作。\n泥沙何足道，正当为善谑。\n子云老嗜酒，行当蹑芒屩。\n为君说难字，犹能中一喙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45202,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"望浯台示无竞","author":"沈辽","text":"每爱潇江西北流，水边幽石强为留。\n归时欲借浯台望，何处陂陁可系舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45203,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"太平上方","author":"沈辽","text":"山上白云淡无情，不如山前利与名。\n水西落日何时尽，二十一万钟磬鸣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45204,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送唐道士游南岳","author":"沈辽","text":"潇湘一片云，翩翩上南岳。\n不依涧底石，欲引瑶台鹤。\n乘风出崖峤，带月萦林薄。\n若会洪崖生，为求金鼎药。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45205,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠张明之","author":"沈辽","text":"文雅张夫子，飘然东岭居。\n不随人毁誉，独与道盈虚。\n欢笑一棋局，湛沈万卷书。\n三年流窜客，相见止如初。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45206,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"唁下第","author":"沈辽","text":"时去亦可惜，浩然若沧溟。\n平生穷古学，老大困新经。\n君抱松竹操，余无龟筮灵。\n相看故眼在，惟有遥山青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45207,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"朱赵二使者示问","author":"沈辽","text":"古木巃嵷山径斜，不知使者出山窊。\n羁禽野兽遥相避，亦有人寻颜阖家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45208,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"零陵观大水","author":"沈辽","text":"春雨淫不已，江水一夕涨。\n初闻渐其栅，离明已三丈。\n老弱走山去，浮沉困丁壮。\n高楼半欲没，木杪维舟舫。\n睢阜已怀襄，那能辨闾巷。\n升高瞰其下，犬牙萦叠嶂。\n始知地形隘，何由保无恙。\n湘川浩东下，其势不相让。\n安得驱山泽，移徙就空旷。\n市井安且平，黎民获生养。\n群流亦适性，千里肆夷漾。\n斯怀知未遂，蓬茆独怊怅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45209,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢履道天麻","author":"沈辽","text":"仙客饵赤箭，其根乃天麻。\n延年不复老，飞身混烟霞。\n文升蚤得道，山下多灵芽。\n世士所购求，金玉如泥沙。\n吾昔负羸疾，衰龄畏风邪。\n筋骨困连卷，跳偏竟何嗟。\n履道知我欲，囊封寄山家。\n呼奴为煮食，惜已鬓毛华。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45210,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉简莘叟","author":"沈辽","text":"红叶飘萧秋后山，相望止在一溪间。\n老夫无用方安命，夫子何为蚤闭关。\n世事不随歌吹乐，此身略与水云闲。\n经年不见宁相外，安在区区事往还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45211,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵博古赠王道人","author":"沈辽","text":"调笑同方朔，机微似幸灵。\n囊中万金药，机上九仙经。\n虚静孤猿噪，支离病鹤形。\n子云称隐德，于此识沉冥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45212,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏赠莘叟明之","author":"沈辽","text":"仲子绝不出，留侯数相顾。\n二客虽不同，所知均一趣。\n仲子屏世故，翛然掩蓬户。\n留侯喜奕棋，清欢寄玄悟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45213,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉赠王道人","author":"沈辽","text":"身世飘摇如断云，此生不复世间尘。\n能言得丧归诸命，维有东坡王道人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45214,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"平生","author":"沈辽","text":"平生爱闲今幸闲，投老爱山今住山。\n不复区区同眩事，正当渺渺出人间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45215,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"将行泊潇江","author":"沈辽","text":"悯悯久同巢幕燕，翩翩今作北归鸿。\n湘山潇水愁无度，更泊孤舟夜雨中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45216,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿浯溪","author":"沈辽","text":"孤蓬冲雨出湘西，欲向崖间寄一栖。\n天外月华如有意，故来相伴宿浯溪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45217,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢蔚宗木棉","author":"沈辽","text":"峤南地熟气如烟，木华蒙茸散为绵。\n使君作紬远相寄，表似夷锦红欲燃。\n病士榻上残青毡，山中苦寒多破穿。\n使君相赠何可言，困来不妨伸脚眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45218,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"婵娟亭","author":"沈辽","text":"天边新月一弦生，堂上美人肢体轻。\n何似君家庭下竹，孤风高节照人清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45219,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"静照庵","author":"沈辽","text":"扰扰百年何可为，正应静处得忘机。\n心猿不动无馀境，照见人间是与非。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45220,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石燕坡","author":"沈辽","text":"祁阳县南石燕坡，骤雨乾时燕子多。\n行李萧疏常畏雨，谁能驻马待滂沱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45221,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"峡山寺","author":"沈辽","text":"峡山山下古招提，丛木犹藏半泐碑。\n正自会昌多难后，至今龙象绕山悲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45222,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白水","author":"沈辽","text":"九江水色白如雪，流水潇湘尚未浑。\n落日墟头人已散，独留烟树送黄昏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45223,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题文殊寺 其一","author":"沈辽","text":"二公诛茆今几年，至今山下一炉烟。\n驻舟薄致伊蒲馔，欲结诸公寂静缘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45224,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题文殊寺 其二","author":"沈辽","text":"月落山时鱼鼓鸣，华堂不动夜来灯。\n人间扰扰方多事，谁似炉间白发僧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45225,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪后","author":"沈辽","text":"朝来风雪满湘山，顿失群峰上下间。\n风定雪休归舫稳，江流不动碧潺潺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45226,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南台禅师云得蔚宗书报老夫入山","author":"沈辽","text":"支持病骨上南台，一眺云林眼暂开。\n不道云长更绕舌，已将名姓入山来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45227,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"君山","author":"沈辽","text":"我来洞庭上，延首望君山。\n君山不可见，止在狂波间。\n风休水亦息，烟岚露空碧。\n何烦问法意，开口成尘迹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45228,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"洞庭山雪","author":"沈辽","text":"洞庭春雪晓霏霏，一阵风来半已晞。\n唯有山阴吹不尽，田塍片段衲僧衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45229,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵奉赠巴陵上官令","author":"沈辽","text":"古人善治身，摆落在尘土。\n明哲所自任，不为小人侮。\n嗟我一何愚，逍遥寄天宇。\n长嫌柳下污，有意庄生堵。\n微官被黯黮，远放潇湘浦。\n闭关绝世故，况复挥谈麈。\n蒙恩许北下，始接诸公武。\n若得一丸药，顿发三年瞽。\n巴陵遇言游，高文璨瑶圃。\n泠泠挹清风，使人怀玉斧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45230,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉赠上官令","author":"沈辽","text":"洞庭春水静，楚山气雄劲。\n欲言世上清，不敌巴陵令。\n山深多猿啸，水涸纵鳞泳。\n牛刀有馀闲，尽入安仁咏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45231,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"重示","author":"沈辽","text":"不识南宗与北宗，欲齐得丧已非通。\n若将直指生为梦，便可偏知色是空。\n莫为严周驰诞说，欲轻摩诘作衰翁。\n古人言句真刍狗，天外秋来有信鸿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45232,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"代诸生送黄镇判官","author":"沈辽","text":"潇湘秋水涨山阿，小驻归舟绿玉波。\n翰苑主人青眼在，湘南使者荐书多。\n庭中紫诏迎纶綍，道上黄花醉叵罗。\n贱客十年京国梦，恨无羽翼从鸣珂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45233,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠送卢总赴调","author":"沈辽","text":"山东卢翁旧儒者，少年久客都城下。\n先朝数因春官荐，投袂攀鞍学弓马。\n大黄六钧猿臂挽，武库官箭长分靶。\n横门较艺在第一，武士贾勇来相迓。\n天子临观虎豹群，弓满不苦何由化。\n固知穷达不在我，乞得参军何足吒。\n晚除一尉来荆域，白发婆娑谁复识。\n部中夷落寄戎政，上下六年无盗贼。\n使者垂庥太守惜，地薄器寒无势力。\n平生介直耻自媒，一纸荐书终不得。\n中间安南大将出，尝愿奋身借一戟。\n翻蒙羽檄督军粮，灵渠首运三千石。\n小官繇使当自效，解衣操舟上滩碛。\n同行嘲笑何自苦，殊胜陶公闲运甓。\n功劳涓埃何足道，甫得临湘升斗食。\n高堂老母终天年，屏居古寺甘穷寂。\n从来畏慎不干人，粝食布衣残喘息。\n春秋祀事亦粗给，妻子不为饥寒逼。\n三年终丧壮心在，矍铄安能忌吏役。\n古剑不折终不埋，老马岂甘长伏枥。\n却持手板谒公府，斗擞青衫尘土迹。\n我知卢公意可怜，世人□家轻相测。\n何如市井轻薄儿，朝来指白暮为黑。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45234,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古兴十六首 其一","author":"沈辽","text":"朝亦看踰山，暮亦看踰山。\n芳华春树外，古澹白云闲。\n绝顶有池水，昔年栖玉颜。\n妙灵想不驻，缅慕何由攀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45235,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古兴十六首 其二","author":"沈辽","text":"春草日已枯，山中少人迹。\n草间秋蛩鸣，遥知岁寒逼。\n人生何可恃，金丹须努力。\n流景终不回，永叹尚何益。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45236,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古兴十六首 其三","author":"沈辽","text":"我不叹白发，安得新少年。\n往者不失势，后来岂能贤。\n世间亦多士，倚伏良有缘。\n寄语夸夺子，古人已皆然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45237,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古兴十六首 其四","author":"沈辽","text":"修道须阴功，留侯亦何为。\n区区欲报怨，方为帝王师。\n辟谷学赤松，强为女子饴。\n黄石更殉葬，空令后人疑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45238,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古兴十六首 其五","author":"沈辽","text":"皖皖何氏女，不食终不饥。\n普公南迁日，金镜识仙衣。\n清冷少言语，时时露天机。\n冥数有时尽，玉棺有馀辉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45239,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古兴十六首 其六","author":"沈辽","text":"古人喜功名，冒死立奇节。\n嗟我亦何弱，翰墨老蒙拙。\n富贵难苟求，耻随世汨没。\n千年柏庭下，不负金光骨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45240,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古兴十六首 其七","author":"沈辽","text":"不识扬子云，清峭想玄鹤。\n后世欲论文，斯人不可作。\n死生固有命，一眚为投阁。\n相去已千年，空山甘寂寞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45241,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古兴十六首 其八","author":"沈辽","text":"黄叶日已落，西飙易惊衰。\n忆昔阳春下，芳华弄葳蕤。\n四序不代运，生物皆凌夷。\n匆匆盖常理，晚暮令人悲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45242,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古兴十六首 其九","author":"沈辽","text":"百草皆有种，风土不可移。\n甘辛与美恶，所得自适宜。\n东家鲐背翁，前日乃婴儿。\n耄倪寄百年，谁可强扶持。\n芳华有不实，不实未足悲。\n神仙不死药，多采南山芝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45243,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古兴十六首 其十","author":"沈辽","text":"天外青青山，重云忽蒙翳。\n青山终不移，明目未可睨。\n秋风方憀慄，冥雨何时霁。\n不见希夷翁，欲学穷年睡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45244,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古兴十六首 其十一","author":"沈辽","text":"夜半山气冷，始知秋序深。\n开轩望明月，西岭莽涔涔。\n人籁久已息，繁然蟪蛄吟。\n缅怀故丘鹤，清唳有馀音。\n遥与白云期，岂惮冰雪侵。\n人情与物象，邂逅惬幽心。\n夜漏渐已长，清风入松林。\n逍遥掩蓬户，微凉生衣襟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45245,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古兴十六首 其十二","author":"沈辽","text":"潇湘望秋月，清旷无风埃。\n谁知故园影，亦向裔夷来。\n水际衰老翁，练衣独徘徊。\n頫仰方自适，为谁指玄胎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45246,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古兴十六首 其十三","author":"沈辽","text":"落叶何足叹，岁暮皆枯枝。\n白发不可摘，我老谁不知。\n荣瘁乃常理，日月潜推移。\n庄生强欲下，祗能解人颐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45247,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古兴十六首 其十四","author":"沈辽","text":"我意不自适，何为浪多忧。\n草舍亦无事，浩如水中舟。\n陵谷尚或迁，百年为谁侜。\n不作亦不止，生肇知吾优。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45248,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古兴十六首 其十五","author":"沈辽","text":"前日春已归，残花尚赤白。\n秋来初未顷，园林亦早索。\n桃实久已空，黄柑年可摘。\n唯有半折松，青青独如昔。\n少年勿叹息，明年复春色。\n莫疑衰老翁，住世方为客。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45249,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古兴十六首 其十六","author":"沈辽","text":"畴昔一梦还，强忧亦强喜。\n残息若少延，视今谅亦尔。\n何为有得失，宁非为物使。\n长哂王潜夫，区区论天咫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45250,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵酬楚兴三颂 其一 答设斋","author":"沈辽","text":"莫欺隐几维摩老，不为文殊不设斋。\n寂寂青山何所有，霜风落叶满空阶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45251,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵酬楚兴三颂 其二 答施衣","author":"沈辽","text":"给孤长者寻常有，应供如来不易逢。\n二施本无差别理，莫论庭柏与庭松。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45252,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵酬楚兴三颂 其三 答见赠","author":"沈辽","text":"已住世间如影响，不牵法相论偏圆。\n山边茆屋随缘业，不是当时忍辱仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45253,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄金山禅师","author":"沈辽","text":"秋来清血洒潇湘，遥望东流带夕阳。\n为过金山沾法力，便随潮水入钱塘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45254,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日","author":"沈辽","text":"去年九日始离家，行到江南见菊花。\n今日裔夷逢节物，独将白发换年华。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45255,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送毕公绰","author":"沈辽","text":"毕子治车马，游学去成均。\n成均首善地，俊乂方軿臻。\n为儒当读书，术业藏诸身。\n群居久昧是，终亦为涂人。\n通塞虽有时，操修贵道真。\n求益当择友，好德必有邻。\n吾为投裔客，其言何足珍。\n行矣当自慎，思慰高堂亲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45256,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白发","author":"沈辽","text":"山头甘实半已黄，领上白发日更长。\n青云合散寄孤岫，世事悲欢空夕阳。\n我欲乘风学御寇，泠然有意寻沧浪。\n沧浪无人谁与适，青山路远烟茫茫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45257,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"侯滩","author":"沈辽","text":"江流激激过侯滩，更上山头看打盘。\n百岁老人亲击鼓，城中忧乐不相干。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45258,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书堂寺","author":"沈辽","text":"苍山古木书堂寺，北下湘川百馀步。\n谁云往来倾世界，至今人道安禅处。\n岂无惊蛇与飞鸟，后来那复知其趣。\n我身不知今是不，空记名称你常住。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45259,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"日道","author":"沈辽","text":"日道缠南复缠北，蓬户长开少人迹。\n三噫七哀非我意，我身乃是投荒客。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45260,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"种花","author":"沈辽","text":"世事流光同一污，天涯白发未还家。\n慇勤更种庭前草，为看秋来一似花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45261,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送僧应参禅","author":"沈辽","text":"古寺穷居岁月移，东冈西崦不相知。\n从来但识群羊谶，不道亦逢狮子儿。\n潇水荤膻从此隔，雪山消息更何疑。\n明年我过湘西去，问讯山前我为谁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45262,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"花药尘外亭","author":"沈辽","text":"导师昔示化，灵墟肇开凿。\n山间百草花，救病皆为药。\n尔来三百岁，法音亦间作。\n为人布福时，随缘四丰乐。\n然师法王嗣，金锡中天落。\n海众蚤知归，天龙欣有托。\n鼎新金布地，烟云助回薄。\n岣嵝对岑寂，潇湘供盥濯。\n维摩老且病，身世两无著。\n行期过丈室，为我探泉壑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45263,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"踏盘曲二首 其一","author":"沈辽","text":"湘江东西踏盘去，青烟白雾将军树。\n社中饮食不要钱，乐神打起长腰鼓。\n女儿带镮著缦布，欢笑捉郎神作主。\n明年二月近社时，载酒牵牛看父母。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45264,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"踏盘曲二首 其二","author":"沈辽","text":"胡卢笙，不着簧。\n细腰鼓，三尺长。\n吹笙击鼓山之旁，噭跳宛转乐盘王。\n盘王死来三千年，古曲旧词至今传。\n山祥水气不断处，坏木烧作兜娄烟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45265,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山西","author":"沈辽","text":"山西谁家桃李树，半是少年行乐处。\n去年花谢今年开，惟有人生不如故。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45266,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庭下","author":"沈辽","text":"庭下乱生春草花，夭红不称野人家。\n漫开漫落无人折，留得孤根数寸槎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45267,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]